TI  - Complete Genome Sequence of the N4-like Pseudomonas aeruginosa Bacteriophage vB_PaeP_CMS1.
AB  - vB_PaeP_CMS1 is a lytic bacteriophage that infects Pseudomonas aeruginosa. Whole-genome sequencing revealed that vB_PaeP_CMS1 has a linear double-stranded DNA (dsDNA) genome composed of 72,673 bp, with a GC content of 54.9%, that harbors 92 predicted open reading frames, with the greatest genome homology to members of the family Podoviridae, genus Litunavirus.
